# Paid ABNT standards: exclude copies regardless of filename capitalization.
# Store every licensed copy in one of these folders, even if renamed.
licensed_standards/
paid_standards/
*[aA][bB][nN][tT]*
*[nN][bB][rR]*.[pP][dD][fF]

# Public documents and images are allowed; no extension-wide exclusion.

*.docx
*.jpeg
*.jpg
*.png
!docs/assets/README.md
